/**
 * Request-schema contract of MCP tool actions (Phase 6 bookkeeping-1, gap-map item 4).
 *
 * For each action row below, the tool registered under ENFUSION_TOOLSET=all must
 * declare the parameter that selects the action as a closed set: the action's name
 * validates and an unknown name is refused. This is the offline contract that the
 * ledger's T3 rung asks for on an mcp-action row (a contract test whose file names
 * census:<id>); it proves the action is part of the tool's request contract, not
 * that the action does anything (T5 needs a live run).
 *
 * The list was generated by docs/v2/inbox/phase6/bk1-actions-probe.ts from the
 * ledger's T2 mcp-action rows with no link; each entry is [census id, parameter].
 */
